OL,3,GNEWSATwo jailed for 'significant'      
OL,4,Acocaine conspiracy                     
OL,6,FTwo members of a gang involved in a    
OL,7,F"significant operation" supplying      
OL,8,Fcocaine across Peterborough have been  
OL,9,Fjailed after being caught when police  
OL,10,Fexecuted a series of warrants.         
OL,12,FYousif Nechirvan, 31, and Aras Abrahim,
OL,13,F35, were arrested in February after    
OL,14,Fbeing found at their homes in the city 
OL,15,Fwith large quantities of cocaine, cash 
OL,16,Fand mobile phones linked to a drug     
OL,17,Fline.                                  
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
